ruy: cmake_minimum_required before project(), so CMAKE_MSVC_RUNTIME_LIBRARY applies under MSVC.

ruy calls project() before cmake_minimum_required(): at project() CMP0091 is not set yet (its default
CMAKE_POLICY_DEFAULT_CMP0091 is applied only by cmake_minimum_required/cmake_policy(VERSION)), and MSVC gets /MD
in CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS_<CONFIG>. The superbuild for windows_x64 gives every dependency the static CRT (/MT), so the
tests with tflite (runtime, runtime_manager, model) do not link: LNK2038 RuntimeLibrary MD_DynamicRelease against
MT_StaticRelease in ruy_*.lib. The order of the calls is as in the other dependencies.

